## Models, datasets and integrations

No machine-learning model, externally sourced dataset, paid API, or production credit data is included. Product, company, user, document, FNS/BKI response, and risk-score data are synthetic and are created locally by `credit.seed` and `credit.mock`. The named FNS, BKI, S3, scoring and disbursement behaviors are local emulations. No request is sent to a government, credit-bureau, bank or production scoring service.
